{"id":"transalp-mtb","title":"Transalp by mountain bike: Garmisch to Lake Garda","who":"Classic route · crossing the Alps on dirt","when":"July to September","vehicle":"Mountain bike, 5–7 days","kind":"bike","color":"#4338ca","summary":"The classic Alpencross from the Zugspitze to the palms of Lake Garda: about 350 km and 6–7,000 m of climbing on forest roads and trails through Tyrol, over the Reschen pass, down the Val Venosta's apple orchards, past Merano and the Dolomites' edge to Riva. Hotels and a shuttle back.","sources":[{"label":"Bergwelten: from Garmisch to Lake Garda on two routes","url":"https://www.bergwelten.com/a/von-garmisch-an-den-gardasee-im-twin-konzept-auf-zwei-verschiedenen-routen-an-den-lago"},{"label":"Outdoor Magazin: Alpencross by bike from Garmisch to Riva","url":"https://www.outdoor-magazin.com/service/touren-planung/alpencross-mit-dem-fahrrad-von-garmisch-nach-riva.794077.3.htm"}],"approximate":"Main stage towns; the line follows cycle routes and tracks near the line shown.","km":344,"bbox":[10.486,45.8868,11.3034,47.4924],"stops":[{"name":"Garmisch-Partenkirchen","place":"Garmisch-Partenkirchen","at":[47.4924,11.0963],"text":"Under the Zugspitze, the start."},{"name":"Ehrwald","place":"Ehrwald, Austria","at":[47.3987,10.9205],"text":"Into Tyrol.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Zugspitze-Blick_auf_Ehrwald.jpg/500px-Zugspitze-Blick_auf_Ehrwald.jpg","page":"Ehrwald","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zugspitze-Blick_auf_Ehrwald.jpg","credit":"A.Lehr","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Imst","place":"Imst, Austria","at":[47.2382,10.7407],"text":"Over the Fernpass to the Inn valley.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Johanneskirche_2011.JPG/500px-Johanneskirche_2011.JPG","page":"Imst","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Johanneskirche_2011.JPG","credit":"Les Ailes du Desir","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Nauders","place":"Nauders, Austria","at":[46.8918,10.5026],"text":"Up the Inn to the Reschen pass and the drowned church tower in the lake.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Reschenpass_Passhoehe_Blick_Sued.jpg/500px-Reschenpass_Passhoehe_Blick_Sued.jpg","page":"Reschen Pass","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Reschenpass_Passhoehe_Blick_Sued.jpg","credit":"Sönke Kraft aka Arnulf zu Linden","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Merano","place":"Merano, Italy","at":[46.6714,11.1646],"text":"Down the Val Venosta's apple orchards.","source":{"label":"Bergwelten","url":"https://www.bergwelten.com/a/von-garmisch-an-den-gardasee-im-twin-konzept-auf-zwei-verschiedenen-routen-an-den-lago"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Karte_Vinschgau.png/500px-Karte_Vinschgau.png","page":"Vinschgau","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Karte_Vinschgau.png","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Caldaro","place":"Caldaro sulla Strada del Vino","at":[46.4135,11.2469],"text":"The wine road and its lake."},{"name":"Andalo","place":"Andalo, Italy","at":[46.1617,11.0076],"text":"Under the Brenta Dolomites.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Dolomiti_di_Brenta.jpg/500px-Dolomiti_di_Brenta.jpg","page":"Brenta group","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dolomiti_di_Brenta.jpg","credit":"Markus Bernet","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0"}},{"name":"Riva del Garda","place":"Riva del Garda","at":[45.8867,10.8458],"text":"Down to the lake and an ice cream.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/La_Rocca_di_Manerba_del_Garda_con_l%27isola_dei_Conigli.jpg/500px-La_Rocca_di_Manerba_del_Garda_con_l%27isola_dei_Conigli.jpg","page":"Lake Garda","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:La_Rocca_di_Manerba_del_Garda_con_l%27isola_dei_Conigli.jpg","credit":"Photo by Guido Adler. Upload by Moroder","license":"CC BY